Package: dar
Title: Differential Abundance Workflows for Microbiome Data
Version: 1.9.1
Date: 2025-10-14
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Francesc",
             family = "Catala-Moll",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "fcatala@irsicaixa.es",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2354-8648"))
    )
Description: Provides recipe-based workflows for differential abundance
    analysis of microbiome data from phyloseq and TreeSummarizedExperiment
    objects. A pipeable interface combines preprocessing, quality control
    and multiple statistical methods. Users can inspect method-specific
    results and summarize agreement using optional consensus rules.
